            "content": "We will explain the simplest techniques and strategies for trading meanreverting portfolios (linear, Bollinger band, Kalman fi lter), and whether us ing raw prices, log prices, or ratios make the most sense as inputs to these tests and strategies. In particular, we show that the Kalman fi lter is useful"
          }
